# When ppg3 lived as a subdirectory of pypipegraph2, that repo's root
# .gitignore had a `core*` rule (for crash-dump files like `core.12345`)
# that also swept up this workspace's `core/` crate. The un-ignore below is
# now redundant in the standalone repo but kept as a guard in case this tree
# is ever vendored back under such a rule.
!core/
!core/**
test/
